  "changelog": "Initial release of geoskill-education-resource-allocation.\n\n- Supports spatial allocation of students to schools under capacity and accessibility constraints using population rasters.\n- Provides both allocation (coverage and equity evaluation) and optimal siting of new schools via a greedy p-median algorithm.\n- Offers metrics for equity assessment: Gini coefficient or coefficient of variation.\n- Outputs results and reports as JSON files.\n- Runs fully offline; includes an option for synthetic data generation.\n- Requires Python with numpy, scipy, geopandas, and shapely dependencies.",
